---
title: "parse_accumulator_merkle_root_from_vaa_payload (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_cursor: msg_cursor = cursor::new(message)
    q_cursor --> q_type: payload_type = deserialize_u32(msg_cursor)
    q_type --> q_check_magic: payload_type == ACCUMULATOR_UPDATE_WORMHOLE_VERIFICATION_MAGIC
    q_check_magic --> q_abort: false, abort E_INVALID_WORMHOLE_MESSAGE
    q_check_magic --> q_wh_type: true
    q_wh_type --> q_check_wh: wh_message_payload_type = deserialize_u8(msg_cursor)
    q_check_wh --> q_abort2: != 0, abort E_INVALID_WORMHOLE_MESSAGE
    q_check_wh --> q_skip: == 0 (Merkle variant)
    q_skip --> q_hash: skip slot (u64) and ring_size (u32)
    q_hash --> q_extract: merkle_root_hash = deserialize_vector(msg_cursor, 20)
    q_extract --> q_rest: cursor::take_rest(msg_cursor)
    q_rest --> [*]: return bytes20::new(merkle_root_hash)

    note right of q_check_magic
        INV-001: payload must start with ACCUMULATOR_UPDATE_WORMHOLE_VERIFICATION_MAGIC
        INV-002: payload type must be 0 (Merkle variant)
        INV-003: merkle root hash is exactly 20 bytes
    end note
